2026-07-27T09:47:23.5321941Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5322607Z i /tmp/RtmpDBQmbv/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5323124Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5323509Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5323834Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5324337Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5325082Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:47:23.5325970Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
